{
  "lineCounts": {
    "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}": 2,
    "Black Screen": 1,
    "Magnifico": 28,
    "Paimon": 9,
    "Player": 6
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7507007",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "750700701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "750700701": {
            "id": "750700701",
            "speakerId": 21586,
            "speakerName": "Magnifico",
            "text": "Haha! I knew we'd meet again! Your timing is impeccable, too — you are about to witness my second masterpiece!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750700702"
            ]
          },
          "750700702": {
            "id": "750700702",
            "speakerId": 21586,
            "speakerName": "Magnifico",
            "text": "Hmm... Maybe not the second. I do have a ton of fine works, don't I...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750700703"
            ]
          },
          "750700703": {
            "id": "750700703",
            "speakerId": 21586,
            "speakerName": "Magnifico",
            "text": "Either way, you're most fortunate, for you shall witness me attempt dynamic photography for the first time!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750700704"
            ]
          },
          "750700704": {
            "id": "750700704",
            "speakerId": 21586,
            "speakerName": "Magnifico",
            "text": "After all, the photos I used to take were all those of victims at crime scenes... Uh, never mind. That does not bear going into detail about...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750700705"
            ]
          },
          "750700705": {
            "id": "750700705",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So, do you need our help again this time, Mr. Magnifico?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750700706"
            ]
          },
          "750700706": {
            "id": "750700706",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Rawr?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750700707"
            ]
          },
          "750700707": {
            "id": "750700707",
            "speakerId": 21586,
            "speakerName": "Magnifico",
            "text": "No, no, certainly n... Hmm, on second thoughts, that would be marvelous! Come, let me explain the situation to you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750700708"
            ]
          },
          "750700708": {
            "id": "750700708",
            "speakerId": 21586,
            "speakerName": "Magnifico",
            "text": "So, here's the situation. I need to take photos of a Qucusaurus diving toward the water's surface at this waterfall. We want to catch that most impactful of frames, just as it plunges right down to the surface!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750700709"
            ]
          },
          "750700709": {
            "id": "750700709",
            "speakerId": 21586,
            "speakerName": "Magnifico",
            "text": "I've hidden food that can attract Qucusaurs in the pond beneath the waterfall. It's just that... *sigh* Well, they haven't come down at the right angle yet.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750700710"
            ]
          },
          "750700710": {
            "id": "750700710",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm? Hang on. What's that big circle there on the water's surface?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750700711"
            ]
          },
          "750700711": {
            "id": "750700711",
            "speakerId": 21586,
            "speakerName": "Magnifico",
            "text": "I wouldn't worry too much about it, though I'm not too sure what it is... It's just some junk I picked up from a nearby tribe to use as a target.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750700712"
            ]
          },
          "750700712": {
            "id": "750700712",
            "speakerId": 21586,
            "speakerName": "Magnifico",
            "text": "*sigh* All the scrap photos I've taken so far are utterly mundane, so much so that it's annoying. I could keep waiting, but since you're here...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750700713"
            ]
          },
          "750700713": {
            "id": "750700713",
            "speakerId": 21586,
            "speakerName": "Magnifico",
            "text": "Perhaps you could... uh, guide them? Teach them how to perform a most lovely dive? I mean, you are a Saurian tamer famed throughout Natlan, are you not?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750700714"
            ]
          },
          "750700714": {
            "id": "750700714",
            "speakerId": 21586,
            "speakerName": "Magnifico",
            "text": "Alright? Great! I'll send a signal out from here. So long as you can get to the precise location of the target by the water when I count down to \"one,\" we're all set!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750700716",
              "750700718"
            ]
          },
          "750700716": {
            "id": "750700716",
            "speakerId": 21586,
            "speakerName": "Magnifico",
            "text": "Haha, excellent! Let's give it a try, then!"
          },
          "750700718": {
            "id": "750700718",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That's fine. If we fail, all we've lost is time. And we're travelers — no one's time is worth less than ours.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750700719"
            ]
          },
          "750700719": {
            "id": "750700719",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
